            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Meetings take their calendar event's name.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.19</h2>
<ul>
  <li>A call you record during a calendar event is named after the event, like "Growth Team", instead of "Google Chrome meeting".</li>
  <li>Meetings you already recorded are renamed the next time Jarvis starts.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
